<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Detect Poison</h1>
<p>Sphere: Detection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Paladin (guild level 4), Necromancer (guild level 5), Healer (guild level 6), Druid (guild level 16)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast detect poison &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast detect poison</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>For a while after this spell, the target sees poison as a (black) aura, 
wherever it is listed:
</p>
<ul><li>food and drink that is poisoned,</li>
<li>weapons coated with poison, such as curare,</li>
<li>people and creatures who are poisoned.</li></ul>
<p>The better your detection sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on 
potions and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Remove Poison</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Curare</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Toxicate</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Detection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>